## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-5.1 Codex
- **Short description:** OpenAI agentic coding variant between Codex Mini and Max; repo-scale software engineering; Responses API only; deprecated in favor of GPT-5.2 Codex.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI native `gpt-5.1-codex`; OpenCode Zen listed at $1.07/$8.50 before API shutdown July 2026. Responses API only.
