- **IDs:** `<provider>/gpt-5.1-codex`; no Free ID on Zen (`noFreeId: true`)
- **Context window:** 400,000 total (128,000 out) — confirmed via Artificial Analysis
- **Modalities:** Text, image in; text out. Reasoning yes. Tool calls implied by Codex class but not separately documented for this SKU.
- **Pricing (as of <date>):** OpenAI native $1.25 / $10.00 per 1M ($0.125 cached); OpenCode Zen $1.07 / $8.50 per 1M. Data-usage caveat: proprietary, responses-API-only.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary; parameter count undisclosed

